WEBVTT

00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:32.495
Chắc là chị nghe thấy
từng lỗi tôi mắc phải."

00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:36.553
Và họ im bặt. (Cười)

00:00:36.553 --> 00:00:38.950
Rồi họ chờ tôi đi chỗ khác

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.187
và nói chuyện 
với người khác.

00:00:41.187 --> 00:00:43.222
Một nhóm khác,

00:00:43.222 --> 00:00:45.647
mắt họ sáng lên,

00:00:45.647 --> 00:00:46.878
và nói

00:00:46.878 --> 00:00:51.187
"Chị là người 
tôi muốn nói chuyện."

00:00:51.187 --> 00:00:53.607
Và bắt đầu kể 
trên trời dưới đất

00:00:53.607 --> 00:00:56.142
những thứ họ nghĩ 
tiếng Anh đang sai

00:00:56.142 --> 00:00:58.511
(Cười)

00:00:58.511 --> 00:01:00.828
Vài tuần trước, 
tôi dự một tiệc tối